  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cleaner Production Ready Made Garment (RMG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, a roadmap will be developed to combat the pollution caused by the Ready Made Garment (RMG) industry on the Meghna River and the drinking water supply of the nearby city of Dhaka, Bangladesh. Measures will be proposed to address the negative influence of using Cleaner Production (CP) technology, and a strategy for implementation will be formulated, taking into account opportunities for cooperation with the private sector, authorities and other donors and showcase demonstrations. The overall aim is to secure a sustainable future for RMG small- and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) and their significant social and economic impact on the region by complying with environmental standards and regulations.</narrative>
  </description>
